# JAV Downloader — Core Rules

Read `AGENTS.md` at repo root first. This repo is developed with **Cursor (ACP in Zed)** and **Zed Agent (freebuff2api / GLM 3.1)** — both must follow the same constraints.

## Stack

- Python 3.10+ backend (`src/jav_downloader/`)
- SolidJS + Vite frontend (`web/frontend/` → built to `src/jav_downloader/web/static/`)
- pytest test suite (`tests/`)

## Where code belongs

- Site parsing → `src/jav_downloader/sites/`
- Shared config/network/migrations → `src/jav_downloader/core/`
- Web HTTP/jobs → `src/jav_downloader/web/`
- CLI → `src/jav_downloader/cli/`

## Never

- Break legacy API: `CreateSite`, `is_url_vaildate`, `VaildateUrl`
- Commit secrets, cookies, videos, or PII logs
- Require Node at runtime (Termux ships pre-built static UI)
- Refactor unrelated code in the same change
- Create commits/PRs/docs unless explicitly asked

## Always

- Run `make test` before considering work done
- Keep diffs small and verifiable (especially for GLM 3.1 sessions)
- Check `CONTRIBUTING.md` before PR-worthy changes
- Kill ffmpeg subprocesses on cancel (`site._ffmpeg_proc`)

## Commands

```bash
make install && make test
make web-build   # after frontend changes
```
